summary.label:
*Altimeter Compass* app provides you with:
1. Altitude, latitude and longitude data reading from GPS;
2. Tap the compass face to show or hide accessory(level, sunrise/sunset and speedometer);
3. Choose your compass theme such as Classic, Waves, Rings and Maps;
4. Capturing photo and adding environment information on photo(iPhone only currently);
5. Seamless switching between light mode and dark mode, and picking your font;
6. Reading altitude from the device's altimeter (requires iPhone 12 or newer models, iOS 15 or newer system);
7. Reading real-time barometric pressure readings from the device's barometer;
8. Switch display modes by clicking on altitude, barometric pressure, and coordinate text labels.
